---
import { BASIC_TERMS } from '../../consts/product';
import { capitalize, numberWord } from '../../lib/format';
import Row from '../Row.astro';
import Section from '../Section.astro';
---

<Section id="basics" heading={`New to agents? ${capitalize(numberWord(BASIC_TERMS.length))} words first`}>
  <Fragment slot="lead">
    This page uses a few words that are still new to many developers. Here is all you need to follow along.
  </Fragment>
  <dl>
    {
      BASIC_TERMS.map(({ term, definition }) => (
        <Row>
          <dt slot="label" class="t-title">
            {term}
          </dt>
          <dd class="t-body muted">{definition}</dd>
        </Row>
      ))
    }
  </dl>
  <p class="t-lead measure">
    Today, in most frameworks, a turn is <strong>synchronous</strong>: the agent cannot answer until every tool it called
    has returned. That is the problem this package solves.
  </p>
</Section>
